{"ts": 0.055344, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m─\u001b[0m \u001b[93mshelltutor\u001b[0m \u001b[90m─\u001b[0m \u001b[90mStage 3 · Files and operations\u001b[0m \u001b[90m─────────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[93m◉\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m  \u001b[93m3.1\u001b[0m \u001b[90m─\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 251}
{"ts": 0.056197, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97m3.1 — creating: touch, mkdir\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[92mtouch\u001b[0m creates an empty file (or updates the timestamp of\r\nan existing one).\r\n  \u001b[92mtouch hello.txt\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mls\u001b[0m              \u001b[90m# you should see hello.txt\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[92mmkdir\u001b[0m creates a folder.\r\n  \u001b[92mmkdir notes\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mls\u001b[0m              \u001b[90m# notes/ is now there\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nTo create a file \u001b[36mwith content\u001b[0m, use redirection (Stage 4):\r\n  \u001b[92mecho \"first line\" > greeting.txt\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nBut for now, \u001b[92mtouch\u001b[0m for empty files, \u001b[92mmkdir\u001b[0m for\r\nfolders.\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Make a few, then \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m.\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 583}
