{"ts": 0.116018, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97m3.3 — copy, move, delete\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[92mcp\u001b[0m copies. The original stays.\r\n  \u001b[92mcp hello.txt backup.txt\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[92mmv\u001b[0m moves; the same command \u001b[36mrenames\u001b[0m:\r\n  \u001b[92mmv hello.txt hi.txt\u001b[0m            \u001b[90m# rename\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mmv hi.txt notes/\u001b[0m               \u001b[90m# move into a folder\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[92mrm\u001b[0m deletes. \u001b[91mImmediately and permanently.\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mrm backup.txt\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nThere is no Trash and no undo. \u001b[91mLook before you press Enter —\r\nyou, or an assistant typing for you.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[36mA safety habit\u001b[0m: \u001b[92mls\u001b[0m first, then \u001b[92mrm <only-now-that-you-are-sure>\u001b[0m.\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Type \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m to take Stage 3's gate.\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 664}
