{"ts": 0.160159, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[96mQ3: What single command renames \u001b[94mold.txt\u001b[0m to \u001b[94mnew.txt\u001b[0m?\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 80}
