{"ts": 0.174464, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mSTAGE 3 — GATE TASK\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nYou will work inside \u001b[94m/var/folders/jx/f_4n055973x5cwnyh_mhlw9h0000gn/T/shelltutor-sim-home-rgi66_tj/stage3\u001b[0m.\r\n\r\nDo these, in order:\r\n\r\n  1. create a file \u001b[94mnotes.txt\u001b[0m containing the word \u001b[36mhello\u001b[0m\r\n  2. copy \u001b[94mnotes.txt\u001b[0m to \u001b[94mbackup.txt\u001b[0m\r\n  3. rename \u001b[94mnotes.txt\u001b[0m to \u001b[94mdone.txt\u001b[0m\r\n  4. remove \u001b[94mbackup.txt\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nThen type \u001b[92mcheck\u001b[0m. The script will look at the folder.\r\n\r\n\u001b[90mI will check: done.txt exists with 'hello' in it; notes.txt and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[90mbackup.txt are gone.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Type \u001b[92mcheck\u001b[93m when done.\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 611}
{"ts": 0.174864, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 251}
